-- Passage wg6-narrative-writing-p03
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('7cb4378e-37ad-50a0-ae28-b30316e332e2', 'wg6-narrative-writing-p03', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g6-narrative-writing'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Waiting for Crystals$q$, $q$(1) On Monday, Mr. Okafor handed each of us a jar, a pencil, a piece of string, and a cup of very warm water. (2) We were going to grow salt crystals. (3) I stirred spoon after spoon of salt into my water until no more would dissolve. (4) Then I tied the string to the pencil, rested the pencil across the top of the jar, and let the string hang in the water. (5) I put my jar on the windowsill beside my lab partner Lucia's jar. (6) The next morning, I rushed into the room. (7) Lucia's string was covered in tiny white cubes. (8) Mine looked like a plain wet string. (9) The school cafeteria serves tacos every Tuesday. (10) I wanted to dump out my jar and start over.

(11) "Maybe yours just needs more time," Lucia said. (12) I decided to wait. (13) I checked the jar every day. (14) Finally, a few small cubes appeared near the bottom of my string. (15) By Friday, they had grown into a lumpy cluster that sparkled when the sun hit it.

(16) Lucia's crystals were bigger than mine.$q$, 'draft')
