  ('19b71279-6df8-5d39-a254-df07949d392d', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g6-narrative-writing'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Sentence 14 jumps ahead in time. Which sentence would best be added before sentence 14 to show what happened between the fix and the class showing?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Pebble was the best clay snail in our whole class.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Before the fair, Amara and I had never made a movie of any kind.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"backtracks-in-time"},{"text":"The tablet has a camera on both the front and the back.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic-fact"},{"text":"Over three more afternoons, we photographed Pebble's whole trip again, one tiny step at a time.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Over three more afternoons, we photographed Pebble's whole trip again, one tiny step at a time.$q$, $q$The correct choice fills the gap by showing the second round of photos, so the new movie in sentence 14 makes sense. The choice about never making a movie goes backward in time instead of bridging the gap.$q$, 'draft', 'e38778cb-fb63-546c-813b-79a1dc902f6d')
